OL,3,ACold alerts in force as UK sees lowest
OL,4,Aovernight temperatures of autumn
OL,5,
OL,6,FMuch of the UK has experienced a
OL,7,Fwidespread frost overnight - with
OL,8,Ftemperatures dropping as low as -10.6C
OL,9,Fin some areas.
OL,11,FNorthern areas have borne the brunt of
OL,12,Fthe chill with the lowest temperature
OL,13,Frecorded at Tulloch Bridge.
OL,15,FFollowing the cold and frosty start,
OL,16,Fdry and sunny weather will dominate
OL,17,Facross many parts of the UK over the
OL,18,Fweekend, once any patchy fog clears -
OL,19,Falthough rain will arrive in some
OL,20,Fsouthern and western areas on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
